    "detailed_description": "<strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES &amp; CONTENT</h2></strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Short interactable movies in virtual reality<br><br></li><li>Each level, a different universe<br><br></li><li>The audience in your living room will watch you play in both first and third person camera<br><br></li><li>From calm to insane, from dinosaurs to aliens!<br><br></li><li>Cinematic shots and subtitles included</li></ul><br><i>GAMECINE uses both seated and standing modes in VR.</i><br><br>PLANES (RELEASED ON AUGUST 20, 2022)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298620/extras/f044bd37a3d5ab62adb6a6a513dd389f.avif?t=1709231889\" /></div><br>RANGERS (RELEASED ON JULY 20, 2022)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298620/extras/9623c468ad9328dc8b5aa6b39a7c7ceb.avif?t=1709231889\" /></div><br>DINOS (RELEASED ON JUNE 20, 2022)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298620/extras/b8aa50fdd119dc38542499089df9597f.avif?t=1709231889\" /></div><br>BITS (RELEASED ON MAY 20, 2022)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298620/extras/4f3a65fd92cf7b07a05787b28f3cf241.avif?t=1709231889\" /></div><br>WIZARDS (RELEASED ON APRIL 20, 2022)<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1298620/extras/8258868de7057079fe54a46da0b18139.avif?t=1709231889\" /></div>",
